                                                "sense_id": "b27628fa-e5bb-3634-98dc-1c7e5daca219",
                                                "text": "Neffy uses the same spray device as Narcan, the naloxone nasal spray for opioid overdose, according to a spokesperson for its maker, ARS Pharmaceuticals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
